# Web3Forms access key — free at https://web3forms.com
#
# This value is PUBLIC by design: it ships in the client bundle. It is not a
# secret and does not need protecting. Spam is handled by the honeypot field
# plus the domain allowlist you set in the Web3Forms dashboard — set that to
# your live host before going public.
#
# Leave this unset and the contact form degrades to a mailto: link instead.
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in for local development.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
